  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "やぁ、『君』か。こんな埃っぽいところに、ご足労ありがとう"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "ふふ。何か不便はないか、と？　お気遣い無用だよ、これでも私なりにたいへん旅行を満喫している。子供のころからの憧れでねぇ、こういう屋根裏部屋……♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "誰にも邪魔されず、静かに読書を楽しめるしね。今、盛りあがってるところだから邪魔しないでほしいのだけど"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/emo_response-3.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "うむ、そちらの状況は把握している。文明の利器は偉大だね、深鳥くんが入れこむのもよくわかるよ。私はあまり、デジタル機器には興味がないのだけれど"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "館内にさりげなく設置された監視カメラなどの映像を、定期的に確認している。私の出番はまだ先だろうから、事件が発生するまではのんびり過ごすさ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "winter-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/emo_joyful-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "名探偵は遅れてやってきて、いちばん美味しいところだけを攫っていく。それが様式美というものだよ、君"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "winter-civvies_expression/serious",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "使い古された手法に反旗を翻すかたちで、メタミステリや新本格などが台頭したけれど。やはり私は古典を愛するよ、現代にも残る旧きものには真理が含まれている"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "安心したまえ。旅行は二泊三日なのだろう、折を見て登場してさっさと事件を解決して……。私も、それなりに普通に旅行を楽しむつもりだから"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/emo_laugh-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "それまでは物語の読者じみた、オペラ座の怪人じみた傍観者として……。この屋根裏部屋で、下々のものの悲喜劇を鳥瞰させてもらおう♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "winter-civvies",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "君も、長々と私などの相手をしていて良いのかね。席を外していると怪しまれるよ、ちゃんとアリバイをつくっておきたまえ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
